WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.107 line:82%
Chapter 11. Writing. Students write, the laptop finds the mistakes, and you decide what to send.

00:00:08.529 --> 00:00:20.308 line:82%
The first time, open Settings, then "Writing check", and install it. It is free, and it works on the laptop with no internet. It finds grammar, spelling and tense mistakes.

00:00:20.765 --> 00:00:24.227 line:82%
Now open Results, then the "Writing" tab.

00:00:25.814 --> 00:00:31.367 line:82%
Press "New writing task". Write a title, the instructions, and the number of words.

00:00:34.119 --> 00:00:40.368 line:82%
Press "Send to the phones". Students see it on their phones, in the menu, under the pencil button.

00:00:42.243 --> 00:00:46.947 line:82%
The student opens the task, and writes. The phone counts the words.

00:00:48.974 --> 00:00:56.288 line:82%
No phone in class? The student writes on paper, and takes a photo of it. You can also add a text yourself.

00:00:56.753 --> 00:00:59.167 line:82%
Press "Send to my teacher".

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:05.568 line:82%
The texts arrive on your page. The laptop checks each one, and finds the mistakes.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:12.075 line:82%
Click a student to see the text. The mistakes are in colour, and listed below: the wrong words, the correction, and the type of mistake.

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:18.355 line:82%
You are the teacher. Change a correction, or delete a mistake that is not a mistake.

00:02:18.819 --> 00:02:26.456 line:82%
The laptop missed "go". Copy the words here and press "Add". Then write the correction, and a hint, but not the answer.

00:02:27.788 --> 00:02:34.176 line:82%
Write something good about the text. Then press "Send hints". The student fixes the text alone.

00:02:34.631 --> 00:02:39.775 line:82%
On the phone, the mistakes are in colour. The student taps a word to see the hint.

00:02:56.121 --> 00:02:59.535 line:82%
Then the student writes the new version, and sends it.

00:03:03.165 --> 00:03:11.935 line:82%
Open the text again: you see draft 2. Give the marks: task, grammar, vocabulary and organisation, 5 points each.

00:03:48.558 --> 00:03:51.649 line:82%
Press "Send the correction and the mark".

00:03:52.115 --> 00:03:57.510 line:82%
The student sees the mark out of 20, every correction, and why. Well done!

00:04:11.927 --> 00:04:18.716 line:82%
At the end, press "Marks to Record book". The marks go to your record book, and into the parents' report.
